  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #333399;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Graduation Day – 2025 Report</span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Graduation Day marks a momentous milestone in every student’s academic journey — a celebration of hard work, growth, transformation, and the transition to a new chapter of life. ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru proudly hosted the Graduation Day Ceremony – 2025 for the outgoing students of the 2021–2025 batch on Saturday, 28th June 2025, at the College Auditorium.</p>\n\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Yoga-day-report-2025.pdf\" data-wp-editing=\"1\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">DOWNLOAD&nbsp; REPORT</span>[/caption]\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</h5>",
